WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.860
This diagram illustrates our taxonomy.

2
00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.720
The outer circle is artificial
intelligence.

3
00:00:06.060 --> 00:00:09.460
Inside is machine learning, where systems
learn from data.

4
00:00:09.700 --> 00:00:12.980
At the center is deep learning, using
neural networks.

5
00:00:13.380 --> 00:00:18.260
Remember, AI is often just a marketing
label, not synonymous with physical

6
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:23.700
robotics. To accurately assess risk, an
ethics committee must look past the

7
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.980
broad commercial labels and identify the
specific deep learning models

8
00:00:28.020 --> 00:00:29.400
functioning underneath.
